Risk Management / State Management Issue \f1\u8594?\f0  Need controlled mechanism to refresh/recenter existing grid without breaking exclusivity or exposure rules\par
Here is a detailed, production-oriented skeleton for implementing soft recentering of an existing grid when a new high-conviction grid signal arrives.\par
This approach tries to keep most of the safety properties of the current system while allowing meaningful updates when the market has drifted significantly.\par
Design Goals of this Implementation\par
Preserve exclusivity \f2\emdash  still only one active grid instance per symbol\par
Only unfilled orders are adjusted \emdash  filled legs (actual positions) remain untouched\par
Atomic-ish operation \emdash  cancel + replace in quick sequence with locking\par
Safety gates \emdash  minimum drift, confidence improvement, cooldown, max frequency\par
Audit trail \emdash  very clear logging of every change\par
No new positions created during recenter \emdash  only modifies existing structure\par
RiskManager exposure unchanged \emdash  total allocated capital stays the same\par
\par
